  (155,155,'Ngành Xuất bản đòi hỏi những cá nhân có tố chất tư duy logic sắc bén để cấu trúc nội dung, sự tỉ mỉ trong khâu biên tập và kiểm duyệt, cùng với óc sáng tạo không ngừng để tạo ra những ấn phẩm thu hút. Khả năng giao tiếp xã hội tốt là nền tảng cho việc xây dựng mối quan hệ với tác giả và đối tác.  Để thành công, bạn cần trau dồi kỹ năng biên tập, thiết kế dàn trang, quản lý dự án và am hiểu sâu về thị trường sách. Môi trường làm việc chủ yếu là văn phòng, thường xuyên làm việc nhóm dưới áp lực thời gian để đáp ứng các kỳ hạn phát hành. Các vị trí như biên tập viên, họa sĩ minh họa, nhà làm sách, chuyên viên marketing sách đóng vai trò quan trọng trong chuỗi giá trị xuất bản.','[0.016622165,-0.049309243,-0.09757572,-0.17151964,0.0933982,0.1664687,-0.12164512,-0.3709938,-0.12263807,-0.074256465,0.169488,-0.11024892,-0.13879631,-0.10962674,-0.22245352,0.37497523,-0.14535956,0.17861159,0.18670179,-0.2448081,-0.34576625,-0.1978582,0.3083467,-0.061970185,-0.096928254,0.041213922,-0.058340076,-0.32262608,0.025620248,0.03949808,-0.026484422,-0.024068438,-0.025133286,0.06955379,0.15919416,0.16220257,-0.18141855,0.20390205,0.116525576,-0.2735198,-0.01624671,-0.20954688,0.0013304552,0.3577212,-0.050694577,-0.2539647,-0.23511015,0.09813858,0.18700555,0.29046118,-0.083637945,-0.06257976,-0.11894386,0.24151173,-0.037886888,0.16145205,-0.007860881,0.12586538,0.21299432,0.062176842,0.07340746,-0.1262611,-0.060013846,0.29211575,0.20840886,-0.12139061,0.12061423,0.06009118,-0.24842411,0.03654699,0.18259244,-0.0911491,-0.16879693,-0.05257742,-0.076934405,0.09115417,-0.23173934,0.17093876,0.09469607,0.12247202,-0.0035111792,0.20492142,-0.009624368,0.36798316,-0.13076447,-0.19890244,0.08884675,-0.05684082,-0.15752448,-0.093081705,0.24840888,0.23658034,0.33498144,0.06984355,0.04571565,0.017723862,-0.02190834,-0.18213846,-0.21078023,-0.32098496,0.13390462,0.17861423,0.16414508,-0.06721452,-0.042176064,-0.3383725,0.03142285,0.08449836,-0.012549692,-0.07109514,0.060042318,-0.0682