  (209,209,'Khoa học máy tính luôn tìm kiếm những bộ óc có tư duy hệ thống, khả năng trừu tượng hóa tốt và sự kiên trì trong việc gỡ lỗi phần mềm. Người học phải làm chủ kỹ năng thiết kế cấu trúc máy tính, phát triển hệ điều hành và phân tích ngôn ngữ lập trình. Đa số chuyên gia làm việc trong môi trường văn phòng năng động tại các tập đoàn công nghệ toàn cầu, viện nghiên cứu trí tuệ nhân tạo hoặc các công ty khởi nghiệp đột phá. Vốn từ vựng hàng ngày bao trùm các khái niệm như kiến trúc máy tính, trình biên dịch, thuật toán tìm kiếm, lý thuyết tính toán, cấu trúc dữ liệu và hệ thống phân tán. Đây là ngành học nền tảng, đào tạo ra những nhà kiến tạo công nghệ, những người xây dựng phần lõi cho toàn bộ thế giới số hóa hiện đại.','[-0.026017679,-0.13823277,-0.1245744,0.16035698,0.03873044,0.06767537,0.2709546,-0.18073899,0.06708984,-0.11288983,0.013593014,0.27430534,-0.010833056,-0.07870502,-0.27721885,0.21284008,0.20742086,0.0006339966,-0.06505018,-0.0631278,0.029178156,-0.039147202,0.2698198,-0.10350606,-0.34848332,-0.15607668,-0.10683747,-0.10864699,0.20953718,0.020173311,0.049171466,0.091384344,-0.0720209,-0.16422586,0.24537289,-0.14251032,-0.037212446,0.14889944,0.04881101,0.008181441,-0.12826093,0.19475055,0.016708823,0.21787573,-0.3419421,0.05182466,-0.106959194,0.19175692,0.08484724,0.049676154,0.12648493,0.06178217,-0.15908214,0.0046074013,-0.20698626,0.17872655,0.15880506,-0.022023953,-0.07733175,0.1437526,0.036194757,-0.28854415,0.27031687,0.16958714,-0.08898084,-0.10982467,-0.047284015,0.015025689,0.01722335,-0.055137575,0.11703061,-0.04957172,-0.2729113,0.041923214,-0.050798528,-0.046926636,0.027370607,0.03215873,0.25223678,-0.12244857,0.046828173,-0.31369728,0.07594539,0.0040262714,0.021410318,0.044003904,-0.03348486,0.05732205,-0.07260605,-0.041424483,0.03217427,0.034826335,0.24771643,0.06367521,0.05054364,0.09189822,0.08385816,0.04129127,0.20665616,-0.4523848,-0.109970026,0.12556772,0.028456166,-0.15850046,-0.22350398,-0.25886115,-0.019527066,0.2004292