  (210,210,'Ngành này đòi hỏi sự nhanh nhạy trong tư duy khắc phục sự cố, khả năng thích ứng cao và tính kỷ luật nghiêm ngặt khi tuân thủ các giao thức an toàn. Về kỹ năng, bạn cần thành thạo việc cấu hình hạ tầng mạng, giám sát lưu lượng và triển khai các phương thức truyền tải dữ liệu. Môi trường làm việc chủ yếu là các trung tâm dữ liệu quy mô lớn, nhà cung cấp dịch vụ viễn thông hoặc phòng IT của các doanh nghiệp đa quốc gia. Thuật ngữ chuyên ngành bao gồm giao thức định tuyến, bảo mật mạng, kiến trúc phần mềm phân tán, truyền thông không dây, mạng diện rộng và điện toán đám mây. Trở thành kỹ sư mạng, bạn sẽ là người gìn giữ huyết mạch thông tin, đảm bảo thế giới luôn được kết nối liên tục, an toàn và thông suốt mọi lúc mọi nơi.','[-0.07899441,-0.17162846,0.10218824,0.040935326,-0.13518062,-0.20373634,0.053169455,-0.22628166,-0.030894335,-0.10817401,0.27298948,0.116373084,0.08776418,-0.35879475,-0.45303154,0.07554432,-0.1486923,0.15893008,-0.0812848,-0.05047997,0.0038948637,0.09673932,0.16943254,0.115028895,0.07672074,0.018615838,-0.039496567,-0.23632623,0.10822267,-1.0598511e-05,0.11470658,0.028545761,0.013951026,-0.04267174,0.28682727,-0.078445196,-0.10130989,0.16042869,0.20592122,-0.02081136,-0.32373035,0.05984282,-0.19598286,0.11221319,-0.020778473,-0.046324793,-0.11239125,0.14704753,0.099223904,0.166699,0.3457341,0.031254902,-0.27632132,-0.02800192,-0.17855814,0.13558699,0.17943156,-0.093311705,0.06983959,0.27177164,0.22815563,-0.2167134,-0.05545303,0.02569086,-0.20474964,0.10636123,-0.30847356,0.15690367,-0.17684947,0.19270256,0.21788004,-0.032970503,-0.19365445,-0.087544456,-0.0047769872,-0.08254534,0.037908994,0.06854253,0.09474275,0.14971565,-0.060210567,-0.30425033,0.103589065,-0.028293803,-0.12907736,-0.23932356,-0.0018447114,0.26051438,0.082054,0.08707822,0.08941978,-0.1211992,0.40465945,0.075109825,-0.08411067,0.13859634,0.15093757,0.042144,-0.05519308,-0.16773692,-0.021651404,0.016303552,-0.013173771,-0.16916062,0.03889357,-0.40093318,0.014938919,0