  (218,218,'An ninh mạng nhấn mạnh vào tính kỷ luật, tư duy phòng thủ chiến lược và khả năng phản ứng chớp nhoáng trước các sự cố bất ngờ. Sinh viên được trang bị kỹ năng thiết lập tường lửa, phân tích lưu lượng mạng và ngăn chặn các cuộc tấn công từ chối dịch vụ. Nơi làm việc lý tưởng trải dài từ các công ty cung cấp dịch vụ viễn thông, trung tâm dữ liệu đến các bộ phận an ninh công nghệ cấp chính phủ. Công việc hàng ngày liên tục cập nhật những kiến thức về tường lửa, tấn công mạng, an ninh thiết bị đầu cuối, mã hóa dữ liệu, hệ thống phát hiện xâm nhập và giao thức bảo mật. Ngành nghề này trao cho bạn sứ mệnh như một lực lượng kiểm soát trên không gian số, đảm bảo hạ tầng kết nối luân chuyển thông tin luôn được vẹn toàn và an toàn tuyệt đối.','[-0.16275318,-0.3500159,0.0729808,-0.060203932,-0.06673859,-0.073781475,-0.22905262,-0.055481028,-0.2306018,-0.31818494,0.20530649,0.04414197,0.038339708,-0.2724748,0.046738926,0.017406126,-0.21975882,0.18010822,0.14149018,-0.01788918,0.08805662,0.1578513,0.023730235,0.018224476,-0.07929268,0.10825065,0.17567731,0.00017099004,-0.01408642,0.06341423,0.03116893,-0.17378806,-0.019022956,-0.02336083,0.55965054,-0.13066502,-0.25883093,0.1199872,0.17661594,0.13911673,0.054586686,0.069969214,-0.25926697,0.09929744,-0.131024,0.027648574,-0.012279123,0.025236089,0.33373573,0.23879169,0.1088506,0.018819977,-0.4471448,0.004025502,-0.042583246,0.04464576,0.07898761,0.068204105,0.10820865,0.11349705,0.2537411,-0.18045789,-0.06886066,0.009299608,-0.04069304,-0.049049407,-0.17686817,0.061129224,-0.15826571,0.029858006,-0.10668112,0.022179322,-0.1256781,-0.010556658,0.053316105,0.19658339,-0.03727522,0.20269312,0.18582495,-0.11122352,-0.057959426,-0.009253763,0.05401253,0.032685738,-0.13940527,-0.028201168,0.098823,0.0803261,-0.13175501,0.036238294,-0.05731591,-0.2810222,0.36058262,0.011016626,-0.1113963,0.014319228,0.23777,0.030154273,-0.0045968923,0.031947974,-0.027857775,0.10594085,0.022323575,-0.2151707,-0.12223834,-0.17538597,0.1672766