  (219,219,'Ngành này yêu cầu sự giao thoa hoàn hảo giữa tư duy thẩm mỹ không gian, óc tính toán logic và khả năng phác thảo ý tưởng mạch lạc. Về kỹ năng, bạn cần xuất sắc trong việc triển khai bản vẽ kỹ thuật bằng phần mềm, tính toán kết cấu cơ bản và đọc hiểu vật liệu kiến trúc. Môi trường làm việc chủ yếu là các văn phòng thiết kế, công ty tư vấn kiến trúc hoặc các ban quản lý dự án bất động sản. Các thuật ngữ không thể thiếu trong nghề bao gồm bản vẽ thi công, mô hình thông tin công trình, nguyên lý thiết kế, quy hoạch không gian, vật liệu kiến trúc và kết cấu chịu lực. Đây là sân chơi cho những người đam mê kiến tạo không gian sống, biến những bản vẽ nghệ thuật thành các công trình xây dựng thực tế, an toàn và bền vững.','[0.08657147,-0.1676856,-0.051766302,0.03903904,-0.009898626,-0.038735244,0.24413736,-0.33516252,0.01926047,-0.21144775,0.16185409,0.079645604,0.19956367,-0.27009124,-0.30980897,0.22328408,-0.06308131,0.2698359,-0.037584886,-0.19852582,-0.17480586,0.046209365,0.16741046,-0.05643485,-0.15295719,-0.014197282,0.058490165,0.061524484,0.21086839,-0.15980797,0.07201436,-0.20658085,-0.03228251,0.08487988,0.391077,-0.23064478,-0.23799922,0.055945594,0.1759097,-0.09781565,-0.34289876,-0.09855935,0.025758145,0.16466556,0.15821801,-0.09351452,-0.10212871,0.08312898,0.28450385,-0.17655735,0.27092457,-0.061303888,-0.26334682,-0.08781939,-0.109809496,0.0028319482,0.101789676,0.06734436,0.2915842,0.16393864,0.3226915,-0.16268991,-0.0012696353,0.1055276,0.018236902,0.24002035,-0.0037707156,0.008470718,-0.13889195,-0.06678354,0.031490043,0.008596284,0.03941641,0.0048016342,-0.0019166435,0.12374094,0.072303526,0.3635758,0.029444288,-0.16959691,0.029849572,-0.27685058,-0.26386413,-0.13759872,-0.18080105,-0.090826064,-0.010738157,-0.12356075,0.17088766,0.060034104,0.0049585733,0.034894712,0.49762768,-0.069894694,-0.0132982535,0.14032373,0.062101737,-0.11207799,0.024622964,-0.13512439,0.05211967,0.24649149,0.19931886,-0.104531616,0.020172913,-0.23789807,0.32849684,