  (227,227,'Theo đuổi ngành ô tô cần niềm đam mê động cơ, óc phán đoán sự cố nhạy bén và tính cẩn thận trong việc tuân thủ các quy trình an toàn khắt khe. Các kỹ năng đặc thù bao gồm chẩn đoán lỗi bằng máy tính, thiết kế hệ thống truyền lực và bảo trì động cơ đốt trong. Không gian làm việc thường là các trạm đăng kiểm quốc gia, xưởng bảo dưỡng chuyên nghiệp hoặc nhà máy lắp ráp của các thương hiệu xe hơi toàn cầu. Bạn sẽ tiếp xúc liên tục với các từ khóa như động cơ đốt trong, hệ thống phanh chống bó cứng, truyền động điện, khí động học ô tô, mạng giao tiếp trên xe và chẩn đoán lỗi hệ thống. Ngành này không chỉ giới hạn ở việc sửa chữa mà còn vươn tới việc kiến tạo những thế hệ xe năng lượng mới xanh, sạch và thông minh hơn.','[-0.086494476,0.056378737,-0.033424724,0.04200178,-0.06897682,-0.013685059,0.3736009,-0.24029864,0.09312449,0.04465214,0.020374116,0.3401475,0.012375926,-0.10478223,-0.029378174,0.0601699,0.07651978,0.0006922667,-0.14957517,-0.16808094,0.13386269,0.20400913,0.19697554,-0.16336817,-0.2769075,-0.33168584,0.22242129,-0.2555856,0.27366382,0.036743086,0.027752066,-0.38463458,0.17501955,-0.08972709,0.20932573,0.016731704,-0.06633325,-0.111312404,0.02157359,-0.40235507,-0.09611673,0.16362877,0.13300623,0.1173014,-0.24941337,-0.028744541,0.08780075,0.20476289,0.06077371,0.036143523,0.0060096313,0.18937081,0.066539295,-0.24411128,-0.11748754,0.2291304,0.14031515,0.14980246,0.330662,0.23231786,0.21083482,-0.15505768,0.02975245,0.18410976,0.2214555,-0.00071068405,0.09803529,-0.07738185,-0.16545631,0.08103735,0.2981913,-0.18112539,-0.06934002,0.28470764,0.027777603,0.05560379,0.040956333,-0.1788481,0.11589381,-0.0463699,-0.12678774,-0.3013415,-0.14226453,-0.12951863,-0.08200155,0.030060235,-0.030649316,0.13232581,0.167735,0.023865573,-0.012956488,0.12702869,0.32538486,0.06548846,0.0032526108,0.0070238127,0.015373124,0.058357846,-0.16297638,-0.35535163,-0.068118036,0.3007473,0.20085463,-0.054103117,0.05595969,-0.23509094,-0.056202717,0.049868364,-0.2284475