  (281,281,'Ngành công nghệ thực phẩm phù hợp với những người có khứu giác và vị giác nhạy bén, óc sáng tạo phong phú cùng sự cẩn trọng tuyệt đối về vệ sinh an toàn. Kỹ năng trọng yếu bao gồm phân tích chỉ tiêu hóa sinh thực phẩm, phát triển công thức sản phẩm mới và kiểm soát quá trình lên men vi sinh. Bạn sẽ phát triển sự nghiệp tại các phòng nghiên cứu phát triển sản phẩm, nhà máy chế biến quy mô lớn hoặc chi cục kiểm định chất lượng cấp nhà nước. Vốn từ vựng chuyên ngành xoay quanh phụ gia thực phẩm, công nghệ lên men, vi sinh vật học, bảo quản thực phẩm, hóa sinh thực phẩm và bao bì thực phẩm. Lĩnh vực này trực tiếp tạo ra sự đa dạng cho bữa ăn hàng ngày, kéo dài thời gian bảo quản và nâng tầm giá trị dinh dưỡng cho các nguồn nguyên liệu nông sản.','[0.13156615,-0.13435438,0.043159146,-0.12559147,-0.044835404,-0.23758958,-0.27869838,-0.29959038,0.103775896,-0.17515902,0.058199823,-0.016127236,-0.12639046,-0.4376062,-0.09012809,-0.044078756,-0.094740115,0.41812363,0.023448253,-0.35574266,0.08321329,-0.06237984,-0.14452508,-0.019248853,-0.055957258,-0.2941831,0.21505602,0.057893157,0.13214552,0.16643454,0.05709395,0.084201545,0.14272135,0.20376925,0.19140923,0.048403863,-0.29099095,-0.12603237,0.017383179,0.037844624,0.09737075,0.26994768,-0.14743705,0.23461153,-0.01021661,0.0057745087,-0.3442353,0.074302934,-0.09272814,0.16292693,0.07237467,-0.04202953,-0.15911834,0.29793152,-0.21847333,0.21849601,-0.0063281395,0.020619465,0.053598836,0.14542203,0.05360228,-0.22812323,-0.032707438,-0.11712319,0.081268735,0.06331157,0.1684996,0.02900804,-0.14586747,0.022299126,0.24046512,0.104483314,-0.12535195,-0.29778865,-0.25444928,0.10003265,0.003787905,0.24441655,0.17662089,0.31029385,0.17701833,0.2394536,-0.0188474,0.09220171,-0.13875933,-0.0715111,0.009512191,0.08637953,0.09078879,0.25281453,0.18731995,0.22145377,0.11922455,-0.11601349,-0.08890466,0.17569721,0.14559108,0.0069169137,-0.13418806,-0.017589223,0.07147535,0.16446988,0.056315735,0.05213943,-0.08078715,-0.4603141