  (286,286,'Công nghệ sợi dệt đòi hỏi sự tinh tế khi quan sát vật liệu, tư duy cơ học nhạy bén và tính kiên nhẫn khi xử lý những hệ thống máy móc phức tạp liên hoàn. Kỹ năng nghề nghiệp tập trung vào việc đánh giá độ bền kéo đứt, vận hành hệ thống máy chải ép sợi và phân tích vi cấu trúc của các loại xơ tự nhiên cũng như tổng hợp. Nơi làm việc trải rộng tại các khu công nghiệp kéo sợi lớn, viện nghiên cứu dệt may trung ương hoặc phòng quản lý nguyên liệu xuất nhập khẩu. Công việc hàng ngày yêu cầu bạn hiểu rõ các thuật ngữ như kéo sợi vòng, độ kéo đứt, xơ tổng hợp, cấu trúc xơ sợi, độ săn sợi và máy chải thô. Lĩnh vực này sản xuất ra những sợi chỉ bền bỉ đầu tiên, khởi nguồn cho toàn bộ chuỗi cung ứng khổng lồ của ngành công nghiệp thời trang thế giới.','[0.030237416,0.024094416,0.047912844,0.23589645,-0.15954407,-0.0611561,0.053435914,-0.21125436,0.025191663,-0.2060643,0.06268404,0.2494215,0.11184103,-0.060824998,-0.3066256,0.1279234,0.04341125,0.14836171,-0.19953166,-0.21369827,0.041786462,0.0024792135,0.21542574,-0.024609974,-0.50661606,-0.09847633,0.31344596,0.27567217,0.024992509,0.11131848,0.07342792,-0.022432303,0.050627407,0.13559803,0.43608314,-0.14885023,-0.2053681,0.10659408,-0.21571428,0.24235904,-0.14166428,0.19654979,0.053766053,-0.022028033,-0.0768012,-0.08741007,-0.4078533,0.05989066,0.23880005,0.0084498925,0.15692084,0.09262787,-0.16803804,0.023347955,-0.38808912,0.22037506,0.25270972,-0.086344406,0.019801559,-0.03863393,0.19151895,-0.15795463,-0.17820424,-0.14824057,-0.057997797,0.25126815,0.081201814,0.16115722,-0.011947854,-0.1292871,0.22393236,-0.15964627,0.080213904,-0.28090632,0.037446987,0.073729225,-0.113747075,0.24543564,0.16461743,-0.05604658,0.06635503,-0.37730053,0.069995426,0.098855965,0.19755767,-0.17712249,0.013213702,0.13868238,0.012858544,0.04238779,0.10992005,0.098423086,0.33568066,0.00886015,0.10241588,-0.007921157,0.03678693,-0.28880915,0.043462273,-0.03915058,0.13589707,0.18438503,-0.014982095,-0.058377445,-0.08012783,-0.1602082