  (313,313,'Ngành nông nghiệp tìm kiếm những cá nhân có tình yêu thiên nhiên mãnh liệt, sự kiên nhẫn bền bỉ và tư duy thực tiễn khi làm việc trực tiếp với sinh vật. Kỹ năng trọng tâm là khả năng xây dựng lịch thời vụ canh tác, chăm sóc cây con và quản lý vận hành các mô hình trang trại tổng hợp khép kín. Bạn sẽ làm việc tại các trang trại nông nghiệp công nghệ cao, trung tâm khuyến nông huyện hoặc hợp tác xã sản xuất địa phương. Công việc chuyên môn luôn sử dụng hệ thống từ khóa như hệ thống canh tác, luân canh xen canh, nông nghiệp bền vững, vật tư nông nghiệp, sinh thái nông nghiệp và năng suất cây trồng. Lĩnh vực nền tảng này đảm nhận sứ mệnh cốt lõi trong việc cung cấp lương thực thực phẩm thiết yếu, duy trì an ninh sinh tồn cho sự phát triển của mọi quốc gia trên thế giới.','[0.151929,0.034204815,0.113747336,0.09917005,-0.10117432,-0.11215957,-0.01592798,-0.15436678,-0.00088515255,-0.35376653,0.03735732,0.03896006,-0.08566215,-0.38133803,-0.13926508,-0.049719404,0.18130045,0.11519947,-0.0713047,-0.23298065,0.07779554,-0.12395397,0.15580311,-0.26971403,-0.42458138,0.020504853,0.13305932,0.15310036,0.01926952,0.015861489,0.10153726,0.11883223,-0.1716455,0.032975636,0.2263606,-0.12337343,-0.37234142,-0.11036461,-0.0880079,0.10887798,0.091011375,0.1435514,-0.05058664,0.1486196,0.026903512,-0.025125226,-0.3320515,0.06462103,0.19954805,0.16215302,0.10779657,0.10579524,-0.17975007,0.2700483,0.021376112,0.25762835,0.085923366,0.07818741,0.39554182,0.029757963,0.2576759,-0.17072372,0.18555455,0.020436242,-0.08556066,0.21381412,-0.04310937,0.090046324,-0.03726953,-0.0056811064,0.2415179,0.05193338,0.02652835,-0.10313824,-0.4147934,0.08406637,-0.065752015,0.1723532,0.034344967,0.11642837,0.14642633,-0.15186049,-0.24109137,-0.10508597,-0.097183116,-0.01593128,0.051979724,0.06297358,0.10115952,0.21870668,0.11328975,0.25993577,0.13891849,0.1030243,-0.04551622,0.19515133,0.080081075,0.043688487,-0.18146424,-0.040479,0.25706792,0.3737309,0.0010233767,-0.09696829,-0.14000233,-0