  (341,341,'Điều dưỡng yêu cầu sức chịu đựng bền bỉ, sự nhạy cảm trong giao tiếp và lòng trắc ẩn để chăm sóc bệnh nhân tận tình. Kỹ năng trọng tâm là khả năng thực hiện y lệnh tiêm truyền, theo dõi sinh hiệu liên tục và sơ cứu cấp cứu kịp thời. Bạn sẽ gắn bó sự nghiệp tại các khoa phòng nội trú của bệnh viện, trung tâm chăm sóc sức khỏe cộng đồng hoặc viện dưỡng lão. Công việc hàng ngày liên tục ứng dụng các từ khóa như chăm sóc người bệnh, kỹ thuật tiêm truyền, kiểm soát nhiễm khuẩn, tâm lý y học, phục hồi chức năng và hồ sơ bệnh án. Đội ngũ điều dưỡng chính là những người gần gũi nhất với bệnh nhân, theo dõi từng nhịp thở và đóng vai trò không thể thay thế trong toàn bộ quá trình phục hồi thể chất lẫn tinh thần của người bệnh.','[0.06261671,0.05664412,-0.09018114,-0.06336569,-0.21835682,-0.13481183,-0.01713731,-0.14727072,-0.18701811,-0.2304399,-0.0870476,-0.097689405,0.040057957,-0.11850868,-0.0014160234,0.19506544,0.07696957,-0.045722313,-0.11428691,0.06960198,-0.0211283,-0.20465727,0.027475022,0.07587041,-0.48337954,-0.13075459,0.012098703,-0.06425313,-0.0029411423,-0.1681491,0.1057556,0.019285223,0.036761727,0.05564858,0.12917371,-0.032056108,0.051166832,0.008817459,0.02931656,0.12583403,-0.22316156,-0.033327937,0.16837098,-0.14439163,0.11331784,-0.012054467,0.023225645,0.030411417,-0.03433983,0.020317812,-0.22695288,-0.044802893,-0.14235288,0.070696205,-0.07617665,0.30891007,0.1016061,0.06495966,-0.015548495,0.05143896,0.05592846,-0.13383201,0.09898634,0.15363987,0.06787692,0.105825745,-0.08526141,-0.08462393,0.0030954026,-0.019331826,0.034956217,0.22422343,0.31260732,-0.088747025,-0.24868312,0.03217695,-0.2934564,-0.36920574,0.16369171,0.37453535,0.26959214,-0.082607724,0.027500486,0.030188648,-0.13093358,-0.17826264,-0.068113916,0.1831407,-0.0024880082,-0.10932627,0.26720962,0.088461325,0.28272498,0.022589844,-0.15416642,0.04525866,0.18472259,0.019671613,0.0085092755,-0.20629339,0.16315025,0.36070254,0.033271533,-0.12706476,-0.23605926,-0.0037568698,-0.1932