  (355,355,'Khúc xạ nhãn khoa yêu cầu sự tỉ mỉ, khả năng tập trung thị giác tốt và kỹ năng giao tiếp nhẹ nhàng để hướng dẫn bệnh nhân trong quá trình đo lường. Bạn phải làm chủ kỹ năng đo khúc xạ khách quan, soi bóng đồng tử và mài lắp tròng kính thuốc chuẩn xác. Nơi làm việc mở rộng từ các khoa mắt bệnh viện đa khoa, trung tâm kiểm soát tật khúc xạ đến các chuỗi phòng khám mắt tư nhân cao cấp. Ngôn ngữ chuyên ngành xoay quanh các thuật ngữ như cận thị tiến triển, loạn thị, kính áp tròng, thị giác hai mắt, đục thủy tinh thể và máy đo khúc xạ. Những chuyên gia nhãn khoa này đóng vai trò quan trọng trong việc chăm sóc cửa sổ tâm hồn, phát hiện sớm các dị tật thị lực để bảo vệ ánh sáng cho hàng triệu đôi mắt.','[-0.1558617,-0.020091416,0.01594943,-0.018586414,0.04888739,-0.03940824,-0.09300941,-0.2615278,0.068997145,-0.16014707,0.2809962,0.24318342,0.022590876,-0.053170472,-0.24821116,0.21175689,0.19167681,0.20626138,0.03650647,-0.15843771,-0.22381695,-0.17940836,0.27440274,0.06155525,-0.11997379,-0.13018975,0.27668926,-0.09644344,0.05666426,-0.0051404494,0.20834856,-0.1651621,-0.045275796,0.049840327,0.028714864,-0.40560806,0.30364704,0.29169384,0.08369301,-0.12043502,0.10024685,-0.18569773,0.11101546,0.30640095,0.24655709,-0.031231526,0.085549615,0.11643206,0.08445111,0.26231137,-0.10434836,-0.012369181,0.0834476,-0.12213516,-0.33841237,0.19214492,-0.05621662,0.030389786,0.030625172,-0.26612872,0.17044224,-0.21267211,-0.0140150795,-0.0064990134,0.05131077,0.1287095,-0.0008116147,-0.22118363,-0.07495442,-0.0143098645,0.11012144,-0.4651492,0.34485188,-0.036581066,-0.061930507,0.08644302,0.118096255,-0.045956865,0.12098992,0.25628927,0.004071732,-0.07638546,-0.046205204,0.050347865,0.18480708,-0.035034534,-0.0411206,0.11187302,-0.09378059,0.05734801,0.2546854,0.13569242,0.27088466,0.14563355,0.025760002,0.050250553,0.109192,-0.24709389,-0.09289238,-0.1796484,0.08794087,0.10189357,0.15506016,-0.1098188,-0.13053444,-0.33594394,-0.03205029,0.10036089,-0.13356578,-0.0487903