  (356,356,'Theo đuổi ngành Gây mê hồi sức đòi hỏi tính cẩn trọng tuyệt đối, tư duy tính toán liều lượng chính xác và tinh thần thép để xử lý các cơn sốc phản vệ trong tích tắc. Sinh viên cần rèn luyện kỹ năng đặt ống nội khí quản, theo dõi huyết động học qua monitor và kiểm soát cơn đau sau phẫu thuật. Môi trường làm việc đầy áp lực bên trong các phòng mổ vô khuẩn của bệnh viện tuyến đầu hoặc trung tâm cấp cứu chấn thương nghiêm trọng. Công việc hàng ngày yêu cầu am hiểu các khái niệm như thuốc mê tĩnh mạch, gây tê tủy sống, kiểm soát đường thở, hồi sức cấp cứu, máy thở nhân tạo và sinh lý thần kinh. Những kỹ thuật viên này là người canh giữ giấc ngủ sinh tử cho bệnh nhân, đảm bảo sinh hiệu luôn ổn định suốt quá trình phẫu thuật kéo dài.','[-0.19963263,-0.26891094,0.031206453,0.06966926,-0.069220155,0.05991318,-0.07221273,-0.021955129,-0.14370589,-0.102226034,0.065299526,0.09856544,0.07540933,-0.19786392,-0.20540832,0.14928882,0.009627301,0.07696115,0.123988934,-0.0013669422,0.18605378,-0.14379907,0.054573976,0.28876188,-0.25854072,0.03317906,0.11569934,-0.108962916,0.026847241,0.03960249,0.010943565,-0.22718103,0.03342715,-0.05696569,0.2505922,-0.34525934,-0.0076335203,0.15568829,0.012368365,0.102249525,-0.21864162,-0.026420947,-0.097509824,-0.07324499,-0.22701004,0.19222665,0.16582891,0.2854814,0.24412195,0.10875658,-0.038666997,0.13722199,-0.20875339,0.3079316,-0.24824062,0.21330202,0.014808185,-0.030044263,0.18647675,0.05414473,0.3060457,-0.27322978,-0.043250106,0.16033652,-0.066854596,-0.14005725,-0.12968129,0.026886052,-0.09483225,-0.31567186,-0.077543885,0.0016066349,-0.034169003,-0.34671432,-0.117485,0.23602138,-0.11621136,0.04349125,0.22052377,0.1652025,-0.14898509,-0.044246238,0.2034819,0.09761315,0.03163052,-0.09521202,0.025447968,0.20596787,-0.008955557,-0.122058615,-0.05544988,-0.029612755,0.17750254,-0.005638701,-0.028425116,-0.02975001,0.1324715,-0.117734015,-0.07063721,-0.051203474,-0.08918853,0.06911014,0.045045063,-0.04676182,-0.3235571,-0.1149732