  (361,361,'Công tác xã hội là ngành học tôn vinh lòng trắc ẩn, sự thấu cảm sâu sắc và kỹ năng lắng nghe tích cực để thấu hiểu những hoàn cảnh khó khăn. Kỹ năng trọng tâm là khả năng tham vấn tâm lý, đánh giá nhu cầu thân chủ và kết nối các nguồn lực hỗ trợ từ cộng đồng. Bạn sẽ phát triển sự nghiệp tại các tổ chức phi chính phủ, trung tâm bảo trợ xã hội, bệnh viện hoặc phòng tham vấn học đường. Hành trang nghề nghiệp gắn liền với các khái niệm như an sinh xã hội, tham vấn tâm lý, phát triển cộng đồng, đối tượng yếu thế, dịch vụ xã hội và hòa nhập cộng đồng. Chuyên viên công tác xã hội chính là những người thắp lên hy vọng, giúp những mảnh đời bất hạnh tự vươn lên và tái hòa nhập với cuộc sống bình thường.','[-0.028230406,-0.055299632,-0.095277086,0.10219024,-0.12943447,0.08233923,-0.14484785,0.042833623,0.04008673,-0.1626919,0.055343553,0.22769295,-0.2514469,-0.3118448,0.08605127,-0.12766191,-0.040369235,0.16885875,-0.13532233,0.06504592,0.21929868,-0.0410103,0.25978824,-0.20164268,-0.43023005,0.017858827,0.012509458,0.0010729069,0.0053474233,-0.16502587,0.036260355,0.08266132,0.013581345,0.0012014988,0.081776425,0.18319008,-0.100438945,0.30278793,-0.16616884,0.11301979,-0.089890465,0.16927747,-0.058270235,0.09163116,0.10712576,0.008875177,-0.049946565,-0.04468202,0.39182174,0.18216164,-0.023086611,-0.021660384,-0.42132437,0.19771317,-0.09866173,0.33750334,0.09167594,-0.27581364,0.21148422,0.04617281,-0.08642638,-0.20589556,-0.11822264,-0.19634756,0.07158123,0.05947114,-0.18818481,-0.30195683,-0.09265022,-0.10078104,0.19873303,0.09974673,-0.007446925,-0.052944664,-0.22258893,-0.25246587,-0.009570734,0.08742132,0.11943892,0.16138121,0.121443234,-0.29819468,-0.15360788,-0.15586835,-0.04120606,0.035125,-0.101332895,0.060856264,0.0745848,-0.06349823,0.084329374,0.40179482,0.3348381,0.22579543,-0.07266164,0.05303863,-0.011651698,0.038791224,-0.2234711,0.25334743,0.24644083,0.2971813,-0.16287923,-0.011675487,-0.27938554,-0.045330655,0.017771155,0.17960872,-0.0651469,0.065