  (362,362,'Ngành Công tác thanh thiếu niên tìm kiếm những người năng động, thấu hiểu tâm lý tuổi vị thành niên và có khả năng truyền cảm hứng mạnh mẽ. Bạn cần làm chủ kỹ năng tổ chức sự kiện phong trào, thiết kế chương trình giáo dục kỹ năng sống và tham vấn tâm lý học đường. Không gian làm việc thường là các cơ quan Đoàn Đội, nhà thiếu nhi, trường học hoặc tổ chức phi chính phủ chuyên trách về giới trẻ. Các từ khóa chuyên môn cốt lõi bao gồm tâm lý học tuổi dậy thì, kỹ năng sống, phong trào thanh niên, giáo dục trải nghiệm, tham vấn học đường và định hướng giá trị. Ngành học này đào tạo ra những thủ lĩnh thanh niên tài ba, đồng hành cùng thế hệ trẻ vượt qua khủng hoảng tâm lý và định hướng tương lai phát triển toàn diện.','[-0.12850107,-0.10200738,0.07390408,-0.2255272,-0.20711923,0.12744196,-0.006866088,0.062489495,-0.028723342,-0.0019048979,0.24107355,0.28891012,-0.11527717,-0.23370138,0.19789916,0.1132945,-0.10117743,0.091063544,-0.019053588,0.12185923,-0.06780125,-0.011711048,0.18914632,0.08452794,-0.09688712,-0.056021716,0.050841782,-0.19825251,0.15744959,-0.41692913,0.011941689,0.13604648,0.073893934,-0.26406,0.58297,-0.15209103,-0.1012,0.2889153,0.2533441,0.3585438,0.2469425,-0.18671212,0.050082747,0.12866753,0.010050236,0.054707494,-0.049326982,0.032897495,0.42121089,0.004621677,0.018820694,-0.055537753,-0.31287473,0.23287235,-0.03468146,0.21037483,0.22675264,0.047563307,0.39664292,-0.055488795,0.15198389,-0.17062633,0.002566012,0.13730429,0.248571,0.27128384,-0.022666723,-0.16715899,-0.103477776,-0.32513356,0.0046259207,0.16236192,-0.17955145,-0.3060103,-0.22714174,0.011914509,0.13800378,0.21690306,0.2179023,-0.072050124,0.19169396,-0.15223818,-0.2100898,-0.058003645,-0.036056012,-0.105542555,0.16547662,0.045828015,0.015284364,-0.13415945,-0.119945765,0.17495827,0.24312446,0.124069855,0.055270325,0.1166366,0.06138558,0.14702265,-0.3771418,-0.01577798,0.016720986,0.11224289,-0.085388385,-0.16285716,-0.42662784,-0.004076131,0.035475697,0.05439174,0.07263242