  (369,369,'Lĩnh vực này yêu cầu niềm đam mê ẩm thực, tư duy tổ chức logic và khả năng chịu áp lực cao trong giờ cao điểm. Kỹ năng cốt lõi là thiết kế thực đơn hấp dẫn, kiểm soát chi phí thực phẩm và điều hành quy trình phục vụ yến tiệc trơn tru. Môi trường làm việc năng động tại các chuỗi nhà hàng, trung tâm hội nghị tiệc cưới hoặc bộ phận ẩm thực của khách sạn năm sao. Chuyên môn của bạn xoay quanh các khái niệm như quản trị F&B, định mức chi phí, nghệ thuật ẩm thực, an toàn vệ sinh thực phẩm, nghiệp vụ bàn bar và quản lý sự kiện tiệc. Chuyên gia trong ngành này biến mỗi bữa ăn thành một trải nghiệm nghệ thuật trọn vẹn, kết hợp hài hòa giữa hương vị tuyệt hảo và chất lượng phục vụ đẳng cấp nhất.','[0.18089661,0.08240116,0.25682127,-0.26418984,0.11278102,0.024336128,0.10695279,-0.2487412,-0.047262505,-0.09347784,-0.07736498,0.23918352,-0.2887704,-0.14939986,-0.06446395,0.16620472,0.15013188,0.22923166,-0.012268654,-0.22081698,-0.0007270344,0.008660215,0.09026844,-0.14712404,-0.15640475,-0.002831345,0.10709364,-0.05840421,0.2505561,-0.14918675,0.03729073,-0.08719419,0.04007453,0.3233678,0.015655724,-0.024957461,-0.27266765,0.06308547,-0.08401871,-0.12040212,-0.19452375,0.03954334,0.015498051,0.1861317,0.31694707,0.05901985,-0.09859881,-0.04134733,0.07906801,-0.011249482,0.14378963,0.01710663,0.10467586,0.046646774,-0.111086376,0.32540897,0.15322846,0.07576462,0.29582053,0.058710933,0.23424935,-0.22792345,0.16726162,-0.005604377,0.03769624,0.3735068,0.17634211,0.14514221,-0.09999143,-0.07508322,0.37005016,-0.3124258,-0.20637828,0.12388556,-0.23016119,0.17993928,-0.11871018,0.05090667,0.00095275533,0.29823962,0.34543225,0.1103786,-0.090870425,-0.04016324,-0.2826508,0.04633582,-0.055331312,0.068279095,0.21265422,0.06456973,0.2890117,0.164557,0.38323516,0.021505704,-0.01602259,0.2746476,0.063811064,0.037124682,-0.22672969,0.0715966,0.008116462,0.3083981,0.08820773,0.029620834,-0.076493256,-0.31359366,0.05243585,0.1560236,-0.2342618,0.024890792,-0.055384114,0.15591627,0.