  (383,383,'Trinh sát an ninh là một lĩnh vực đặc thù, yêu cầu bản lĩnh chính trị cực kỳ vững vàng, tư duy suy luận logic sắc sảo và khả năng giữ bí mật tuyệt đối. Sinh viên được huấn luyện các kỹ năng ngụy trang thâm nhập, thu thập nguồn tin tình báo và phân tích các âm mưu phá hoại tinh vi. Môi trường làm việc gian khổ và đối mặt với nhiều hiểm nguy tại các lực lượng bảo vệ an ninh quốc gia, cơ quan tình báo hoặc thực địa bí mật. Thuật ngữ chuyên ngành mang tính bảo mật cao như tình báo an ninh, bảo vệ an ninh quốc gia, nghiệp vụ trinh sát, phản gián, thu thập tài liệu và chống khủng bố. Lực lượng trinh sát an ninh là những người anh hùng thầm lặng, luôn đi trước một bước để đập tan mọi âm mưu đe dọa đến sự bình yên của Tổ quốc.','[0.04961238,-0.27151117,-0.017123435,-0.0026650168,-0.024188925,0.054873295,-0.47226033,0.028073432,-0.063819736,-0.22994275,0.15024419,-0.16843921,0.021246087,-0.25724748,-0.15137313,0.11833514,-0.021885984,0.16840252,0.1160508,-0.096402176,0.019941648,-0.030414926,0.33827877,-0.05088151,0.21645221,0.009692767,0.14737427,-0.009100421,-0.24800324,-0.0797632,-0.19144973,-0.19415374,-0.18990645,-0.165833,0.48198384,-0.4606709,-0.051816773,0.04926508,0.26617798,0.021050233,0.016040474,-0.06541557,-0.581422,0.18010151,0.16016242,0.2938109,0.040307198,0.04175742,0.1565445,0.22670206,0.049332786,-0.025559308,-0.57402635,-0.117879726,-0.14728077,0.18886778,0.17727286,0.010087648,0.08505015,-0.06671504,0.29692402,-0.054963,-0.3708326,-0.030270806,0.11636086,-0.07324782,-0.031041237,-0.0026688762,-0.2569446,0.004216249,-0.124249786,0.09075962,-0.24365571,0.30582818,0.058983326,0.24502043,0.09819662,0.054101583,0.0357461,0.17605188,0.017219644,-0.07782149,-0.119983874,0.13501197,-0.0069261617,-0.1335013,0.15395106,0.11044107,-0.15129752,0.18049057,0.06207444,-0.40512457,0.3930785,0.19977254,-0.052204452,0.023538556,0.4470886,-0.21794924,-0.29028973,0.047507998,0.17404476,-0.00589613,-0.15063237,-0.06376806,-0.028714512,-0.083479255,0.043664426,0.2