  (400,400,'Ngành học này đòi hỏi tư duy toán học không gian chính xác, sự nhạy bén với các tham số mục tiêu và tính kỷ luật tuyệt đối. Kỹ năng cốt lõi là đánh giá mối đe dọa từ trên không, chỉ huy hỏa lực tên lửa phòng không và phân bổ mục tiêu cho các trận địa pháo. Bạn sẽ làm việc tại các trận địa tên lửa, trạm radar cảnh giới không phận hoặc sở chỉ huy phòng không quốc gia. Các chuyên gia liên tục làm việc với những thuật ngữ như phần tử bắn, mục tiêu bay, tên lửa phòng không, pháo phòng không, radar trinh sát và tác chiến phòng không. Đây là lực lượng tạo nên lá chắn thép phòng ngự từ mặt đất, đánh chặn mọi phương tiện bay xâm nhập, bảo vệ an toàn cho các mục tiêu trọng yếu của đất nước.','[0.018066375,-0.13167107,0.012698917,0.037376873,-0.083114885,0.025680015,-0.114581525,-0.11236536,-0.013845088,-0.28705382,-0.0047630407,0.13442256,-0.10554763,-0.1248489,-0.21498263,0.18874781,0.1491838,0.14590743,0.04263715,-0.046305776,-0.052510772,0.022971,0.07183169,-0.18322296,-0.23846395,-0.1052984,-0.033707984,0.08620636,0.006913022,-0.08426132,0.06494556,-0.30710816,-0.11253484,0.1068423,0.124252684,-0.08644424,-0.2538454,0.07311301,0.11656739,0.062943906,-0.2223219,0.021623064,-0.026068354,0.06946043,-0.11360765,0.18423542,0.14231439,0.18457885,0.07267494,0.044492643,-0.0119897695,-0.006054051,-0.33727413,-0.2764535,0.0200948,0.18647994,0.03192026,0.022750154,0.24807662,-0.0123954415,0.04632029,-0.17493472,0.10607241,-0.011174723,-0.085967116,-0.06364682,0.11183548,-0.0015877836,-0.10318072,0.002186638,-0.09837501,-0.042370677,-0.28977185,-0.026005901,0.008392289,0.27327025,-0.048470307,0.015059808,-0.07361329,0.1197899,0.026711512,-0.24383752,0.059353705,-0.049406838,0.04712317,0.10436835,-0.03866319,-0.06070951,-0.13371386,-0.08221972,0.067887194,-0.09510113,0.2658392,0.21814907,-0.03680007,0.08786593,0.13696988,-0.034394134,-0.049377408,-0.2521965,0.16084784,0.16218938,-0.1209011,-0.15233517,-0.1737145,-0.25851104,0.018173108,0.020003555,0.016373646,-0.032755468