  (401,401,'Chỉ huy tham mưu Pháo binh là sự giao thoa giữa tư duy toán học quỹ đạo sắc sảo, óc quan sát địa hình và tính cẩn trọng khi tính toán phần tử bắn. Bạn phải rèn luyện kỹ năng trinh sát pháo binh, đo đạc lập bản đồ xạ kích và điều chỉnh hỏa lực chi viện cho bộ binh. Môi trường tác nghiệp thường xuyên tại các trận địa pháo dã chiến, đài quan sát tiền duyên hoặc lữ đoàn pháo binh chủ lực. Công việc gắn bó với các từ khóa như đạn đạo học, phần tử bắn, trinh sát pháo binh, chi viện hỏa lực, bản đồ xạ kích và pháo tự hành. Được mệnh danh là thần của chiến tranh, lực lượng pháo binh cung cấp hỏa lực uy lực, tiêu diệt sinh lực địch từ xa và dọn đường cho các cuộc tấn công quy mô lớn.','[0.007229821,0.105060264,-0.24178523,0.06041382,0.08417142,0.12421165,-0.49080744,0.012609462,0.024410034,-0.25400797,-0.16954145,0.18665987,-0.064643614,0.042613827,0.3203916,-0.030943535,0.29565817,0.120022416,-0.3368359,0.4340008,0.3847147,-0.1286308,0.2846324,-0.13649772,-0.60271806,0.034090158,0.35312706,-0.0045764237,0.03146806,-0.16890804,0.12782268,-0.20719057,-0.21627772,-0.08232572,-0.09474221,0.09629126,-0.07572443,0.24459438,-0.21391246,0.20194036,0.12525983,0.2221841,-0.0017910101,-0.013546544,-0.12293497,0.08688938,0.3448176,0.31719616,-0.05593706,-0.13396344,-0.053068165,0.06532572,-0.3692748,0.15100478,-0.052040625,0.2315665,-0.2925299,0.30336335,0.10359196,-0.12362982,-0.218925,-0.17286064,0.052390687,-0.0007264842,-0.107884035,-0.3102643,-0.4897987,-0.2968783,-0.08914666,0.055585526,-0.15630707,-0.15650956,-0.35654604,0.073656976,0.01886226,0.0031728183,-0.2535141,-0.20856889,0.07580626,0.31250572,-0.087233976,-0.17163022,0.020598339,0.12364695,0.06528108,0.01023483,-0.16651633,-0.058034398,0.08330773,-0.120169766,0.025497817,0.040283848,0.10849056,-0.019423692,0.01963937,-0.1094336,0.072071865,-0.25989905,0.08967584,-0.16616268,-0.15626892,0.012494964,0.18463105,-0.0279312,-0.26397586,-0.27775127,-0.38832167,-0.13648632,-0.09503151,-0.09002638,0.057819784,-0.2077